10-Minute Home Yoga for Beginners

No mat needed. Breathe deeply: Inhale for 4 counts, exhale for 4.

1. Seated Spinal Waves (1 min): Sit tall, wave spine forward and back like ocean waves. Loosens back [web:19].

2. Side Stretches (30 sec each side): Reach arm overhead, bend side. Stretches obliques [web:19].

3. Seated Twist (30 sec each): Twist gently over shoulder. Detoxifies spine [web:19].

4. Cat-Cow (1 min): On all fours, arch and round back. Warms spine [web:18].

5. Downward Dog (1 min): Pedal heels, stretch legs/arms. Full body lengthen [web:20].

6. Low Lunge (30 sec each leg): Step foot forward, sink hips. Opens hips [web:20].

7. Warrior 2 (30 sec each): Arms out, bend front knee. Builds strength [web:18].

8. Child's Pose (1 min): Knees wide, fold forward. Relaxes fully [web:19].

9. Bridge Pose (1 min): Lie back, lift hips. Strengthens glutes/core [web:20].

10. Savasana (2 min): Lie flat, relax. Integrates practice.

Repeat daily for flexibility gains. Consult doctor if issues [web:18][web:20][web:21].
